OL,5,G1100 Call the Bailiffs: Time to Pay Up!
OL,6,     FIn West London, enforcement agents
OL,7,     FChris and Gavin are on the hunt
OL,8,     Ffor a woman who owes nearly #6000
OL,9,     Fin legal fees.
OL,10,G1200 Call the Bailiffs: Time to Pay Up!
OL,11,     FFollowing the work of enforcement
OL,12,     Fagents as they execute High Court
OL,13,     FWrits on behalf of people
OL,14,     Fdesperate to recover money they
OL,15,     Fare owed.
OL,16,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,17,     FExtreme weather conditions play a
OL,18,     Frole in the death or serious
OL,19,     Finjury of four people a day on
OL,20,     FUK's roads. In this edition, cops
OL,21,     Fdeal with dangerous drivers who
OL,22,     Fput lives at risk.
